                "label": {
                    "bold": true,
                    "console": "",
                    "font": "Ubuntu",
                    "key": "label = \"------------------------------\\n\" +\n\t\t\"RUN FLOW\\n\" +\n\t\t\"------------------------------\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Automatically tests batch images.\\n\\n\" +\n\t\t\"1. Python1 checks stop.txt and loads the next image.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"2. IfElse checks have_img.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"   True  = continue prediction.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"   False = stop / completed / error.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"3. RestPutJson sends image to CTTA Flask API.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"4. Python2 parses result and updates UI.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"5. LED turns red for anomaly, green for normal.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"6. Delay loops back to load the next image.\\n\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Folder: C:\\\\cira_batch_test\";",
                    "size": 16,
