                    "key": "label = \"------------------------------\\n\" +\n\t\t\"STOP FLOW\\n\" +\n\t\t\"------------------------------\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Purpose:\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Stop the running batch process safely.\\n\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Action:\\n\" +\n\t\t\"1. Create stop.txt in the batch folder.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"2. Python1 will detect stop.txt before loading the next image.\\n\" +\n\t\t\"3. The Run Flow will stop after the current image is completed.\\n\\n\" +\n\t\t\"Stop file:\\n\" +\n\t\t\"C:\\\\cira_batch_test\\\\stop.txt\";",
